      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST A FAVOUR (1) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only a nose from Cockatoo Lodge in second (18.43) at this track. Good form should continue. DIRTY DANCING (4) racing well without winning, placing at his last five runs. Last start finished 2nd over 312m at this track beaten 7 lengths (18.46) behind Our Girl Franky in a Grade 4/5 on November 17. Overdue and is among the main hopes. ZOMBIE BOSS (2) produced a moderate performance last time when fifth at this track over 312m behind Bear's Head (18.53) in a Grade 4/5. Placed at her previous run. The form out of her last race has been franked. Key player if finds best. SCOTCH FINGER (7) cannot be left out after placing last start.",
